# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Portfolio2025 — environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit `.env`.
# Both Cloudflare vars are required for `npm run deploy`.
#
# Where to find these:
#   • API token  → Cloudflare dashboard → My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token
#                  Template: "Edit Cloudflare Pages"
#                  (or custom with Pages:Edit + Account:Read permissions)
#   • Account ID → Cloudflare dashboard → right sidebar on any zone
#                  (Workers & Pages overview also shows it next to "Account ID")
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Cloudflare Pages deployment
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=replace-me-with-a-pages-edit-scoped-token
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=replace-me-with-your-32-char-account-id
CLOUDFLARE_PROJECT_NAME=portfolio2025

# Optional: production CV delivery — leave unset if you don't have a real key
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# Optional: referral webhook secret
# REFERRAL_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
